{"item": "ds04", "show": "dbza", "youtube": "eFJFRDHDIVg", "title": "DTF", "duration": 346, "lines": [{"i": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 0.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "Hey guys!"}, {"i": 1, "start": 0.5, "end": 3.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "If you're a fan of delicious Japanese snacks, check out Bokksu!"}, {"i": 2, "start": 3.04, "end": 6.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "We did a full review of their September box over on our top cast pod show about the boys."}, {"i": 3, "start": 6.86, "end": 10.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "And if you put in the code, TEAMFOURSTAR10 check out, you can get 10% off your subscription!"}, {"i": 4, "start": 11.36, "end": 12.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": null, "text": "Thanks, and enjoy the video."}, {"i": 5, "start": 12.94, "end": 14.38, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Birds chirping"}, {"i": 6, "start": 14.38, "end": 18.42, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "[Humming \"Come Out, Incredible Zenkai Power!\"]"}, {"i": 7, "start": 18.42, "end": 19.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "[Humming \"Come Out, Incredible Zenkai Power!\"] CHI-CHI: [Opens the door]"}, {"i": 8, "start": 19.92, "end": 20.76, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Chi-Chi", "text": "Gohan..."}, {"i": 9, "start": 21.1, "end": 23.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Chi-Chi", "text": "Vegeta's here, looking for you."}, {"i": 10, "start": 23.58, "end": 24.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "What?"}, {"i": 11, "start": 24.26, "end": 25.14, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Vegeta?"}, {"i": 12, "start": 25.68, "end": 26.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Well..."}, {"i": 13, "start": 26.18, "end": 27.14, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Tell him I'll be right there—"}, {"i": 14, "start": 27.14, "end": 27.76, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "FIGHT ME!"}, {"i": 15, "start": 27.76, "end": 28.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "AAAA—"}, {"i": 16, "start": 29.84, "end": 31.84, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Some of the scenes can contain something funny in the subtitles."}, {"i": 17, "start": 32.52, "end": 34.52, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "If you turned on those subtitles, expect experiencing something similar to DBZA's english canadian."}, {"i": 18, "start": 34.98, "end": 35.82, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Also, RIP DBZA."}, {"i": 19, "start": 36.54, "end": 37.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Vegeta!?"}, {"i": 20, "start": 37.22, "end": 38.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "What are you doing here!?"}, {"i": 21, "start": 38.8, "end": 40.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Pretty sure it's obvious."}, {"i": 22, "start": 40.06, "end": 40.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "FIGHT ME!"}, {"i": 23, "start": 40.72, "end": 41.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "No!"}, {"i": 24, "start": 41.24, "end": 41.74, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "What?"}, {"i": 25, "start": 41.74, "end": 42.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Why?"}, {"i": 26, "start": 42.24, "end": 42.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "NO!"}, {"i": 27, "start": 42.82, "end": 46.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "It's been over a year since your idiot father killed himself—"}, {"i": 28, "start": 46.32, "end": 47.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Saved us all."}, {"i": 29, "start": 47.08, "end": 48.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "—KILLED HIMSELF!"}, {"i": 30, "start": 48.2, "end": 50.56, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "And I haven't had a decent challenge since."}, {"i": 31, "start": 50.8, "end": 52.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "So put down the math book,"}, {"i": 32, "start": 52.48, "end": 53.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "get your Gi on"}, {"i": 33, "start": 53.7, "end": 55.42, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "and fight me like you mean it!"}, {"i": 34, "start": 56.22, "end": 56.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Chinese."}, {"i": 35, "start": 57.26, "end": 57.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "What?"}, {"i": 36, "start": 57.86, "end": 58.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "The book."}, {"i": 37, "start": 58.66, "end": 59.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "I'm learning Chinese."}, {"i": 38, "start": 60.1, "end": 61.94, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Why are you learning Chinese?"}, {"i": 39, "start": 61.94, "end": 63.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "30年后， [Translation: In 30 years...]"}, {"i": 40, "start": 63.06, "end": 64.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "30年后，您就会知道。 [Translation: In 30 years... You'll know.]"}, {"i": 41, "start": 64.56, "end": 65.88, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Also, I'm not fighting you."}, {"i": 42, "start": 65.88, "end": 66.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "BULLSHIT!"}, {"i": 43, "start": 66.96, "end": 70.75, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "You have enough power under that hood to destroy the planet three times over,"}, {"i": 44, "start": 70.75, "end": 72.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "and you're just letting it go to waste!"}, {"i": 45, "start": 72.92, "end": 75.38, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Vegeta, my little brother is sleeping in the next room over,"}, {"i": 46, "start": 75.38, "end": 77.56, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "(Aww, little Goten got referenced) and Mom *just put him down*."}, {"i": 47, "start": 77.84, "end": 79.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "If you're really looking for a fight..."}, {"i": 48, "start": 79.5, "end": 80.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "...Keep it up..."}, {"i": 49, "start": 80.3, "end": 81.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "...And she'll *give you one*."}, {"i": 50, "start": 83.12, "end": 84.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "This isn't over."}, {"i": 51, "start": 84.26, "end": 86.9, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Angrily floats away"}, {"i": 52, "start": 86.9, "end": 87.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Bye, Vegeta."}, {"i": 53, "start": 91.16, "end": 92.7, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Store doors open"}, {"i": 54, "start": 92.88, "end": 95.12, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Why does mom need so much Chobani Yogurt?"}, {"i": 55, "start": 95.54, "end": 96.26, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Senses Vegeta's energy"}, {"i": 56, "start": 96.26, "end": 96.88, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "[Shoots a Ki blast]"}, {"i": 57, "start": 97.2, "end": 97.76, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Wha...?"}, {"i": 58, "start": 97.76, "end": 98.74, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Vegeta!?"}, {"i": 59, "start": 98.74, "end": 99.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "FIGHT ME!"}, {"i": 60, "start": 99.68, "end": 101.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "I'm running errands!"}, {"i": 61, "start": 101.28, "end": 102.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "More like running your mouth!"}, {"i": 62, "start": 102.58, "end": 104.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "How about you run those hands!?"}, {"i": 63, "start": 104.24, "end": 105.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "My hands are full of sundries."}, {"i": 64, "start": 105.96, "end": 107.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "And you're full of excuses!"}, {"i": 65, "start": 107.78, "end": 108.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "LET'S GO!"}, {"i": 66, "start": 109.28, "end": 110.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Okay, look..."}, {"i": 67, "start": 110.82, "end": 112.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "I forgot to get pears."}, {"i": 68, "start": 112.64, "end": 114.9, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "If you go to the store and grab them for me..."}, {"i": 69, "start": 114.9, "end": 115.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "...I'll fight you."}, {"i": 70, "start": 115.86, "end": 116.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "FINE!"}, {"i": 71, "start": 118.06, "end": 118.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": ">_>"}, {"i": 72, "start": 118.7, "end": 119.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "<_<"}, {"i": 73, "start": 120.24, "end": 121.12, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "[Flies away]"}, {"i": 74, "start": 121.42, "end": 121.98, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "WAIT!"}, {"i": 75, "start": 121.98, "end": 122.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "PAIRS OF WHAT!?"}, {"i": 76, "start": 122.96, "end": 123.62, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Damn, Vegeta, you mispronounced pears."}, {"i": 77, "start": 125.36, "end": 127.82, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Thanks for letting me use your telescope, Dr. Brief!"}, {"i": 78, "start": 127.82, "end": 130.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Comet Kamori only passes by the Earth every 100—"}, {"i": 79, "start": 130.66, "end": 131.44, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "An unknown shooting star appears"}, {"i": 80, "start": 131.44, "end": 131.94, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Wait... [An unknown shooting star appears]"}, {"i": 81, "start": 131.94, "end": 132.56, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "An unknown shooting star appears"}, {"i": 82, "start": 132.56, "end": 133.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "W-What's that light?"}, {"i": 83, "start": 133.58, "end": 134.08, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Final Flash theme plays"}, {"i": 84, "start": 134.08, "end": 135.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "That's not a comet... [Final Flash theme plays]"}, {"i": 85, "start": 135.58, "end": 136.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "It... [Final Flash theme intensifies]"}, {"i": 86, "start": 136.08, "end": 136.72, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Final Flash theme intensifies even more"}, {"i": 87, "start": 136.72, "end": 138.44, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Oh no... [Final Flash theme intensifies infinitively]"}, {"i": 88, "start": 139.04, "end": 139.92, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Distant explosion"}, {"i": 89, "start": 139.92, "end": 141.62, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Dick move, Veggie. Dick move.) [Distant explosion"}, {"i": 90, "start": 141.62, "end": 143.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "[fight Me >:( ]"}, {"i": 91, "start": 144.0, "end": 145.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "NOOO~!"}, {"i": 92, "start": 145.58, "end": 147.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "[Growls in rage]"}, {"i": 93, "start": 148.64, "end": 149.16, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Nimbus flying"}, {"i": 94, "start": 149.16, "end": 153.14, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "[Humming \"We Were Angels\"] [Nimbus flying]"}, {"i": 95, "start": 153.14, "end": 153.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "[Humming \"We Were Angels\"] VEGETA: [Destroys Nimbus]"}, {"i": 96, "start": 153.64, "end": 154.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH—!"}, {"i": 97, "start": 154.66, "end": 155.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "(Why is Gohan still flying while on the ground?) GOHAN: [Stops falling] —Ah!"}, {"i": 98, "start": 155.72, "end": 157.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "[Flies down, lands] VEGETA: Got'cha that time!"}, {"i": 99, "start": 157.02, "end": 157.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "WHAT...!?"}, {"i": 100, "start": 157.78, "end": 158.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "WHAT IS YOUR...!?"}, {"i": 101, "start": 158.66, "end": 159.82, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "WHAT IS YOUR *DAMAGE*!?"}, {"i": 102, "start": 159.82, "end": 160.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "I haven't"}, {"i": 103, "start": 160.32, "end": 161.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "I haven't TAKEN ANY DAMAGE!"}, {"i": 104, "start": 161.6, "end": 162.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "THAT'S THE PROBLEM!"}, {"i": 105, "start": 163.2, "end": 165.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "There's got to be someone else you can ask to fight you!"}, {"i": 106, "start": 165.96, "end": 167.1, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "I TRIED!"}, {"i": 107, "start": 168.56, "end": 169.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "No."}, {"i": 108, "start": 169.24, "end": 170.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Oh c'mon, why not?"}, {"i": 109, "start": 170.58, "end": 172.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Because I don't want to."}, {"i": 110, "start": 172.04, "end": 174.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "What, you got something better to do?"}, {"i": 111, "start": 174.02, "end": 174.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Nope."}, {"i": 112, "start": 175.0, "end": 177.82, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "It's still strange that these two never fought before."}, {"i": 113, "start": 178.42, "end": 178.92, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "F*CK YOU!"}, {"i": 114, "start": 178.92, "end": 179.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "F*CK YOU, FIGHT ME!"}, {"i": 115, "start": 179.66, "end": 180.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "[Sigh]"}, {"i": 116, "start": 180.4, "end": 180.9, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "KAMI: 'I got an idea.'"}, {"i": 117, "start": 180.9, "end": 181.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Hm? (KAMI: 'I got an idea.')"}, {"i": 118, "start": 181.4, "end": 182.14, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "KAMI: 'Destroy that pot and blame it on Vegeta.'"}, {"i": 119, "start": 182.14, "end": 182.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Huh.... (KAMI: 'Destroy that pot and blame it on Vegeta.')"}, {"i": 120, "start": 182.8, "end": 183.32, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "KAMI: 'Destroy that pot and blame it on Vegeta.'"}, {"i": 121, "start": 183.8, "end": 184.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Think that'd work?"}, {"i": 122, "start": 184.68, "end": 185.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Uuumm... (KAMI: 'Yes, it'll be hilarious!')"}, {"i": 123, "start": 185.68, "end": 187.12, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Yeah, I guess it'd be pretty funny."}, {"i": 124, "start": 187.12, "end": 188.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Who are you talking to—? (NAIL: 'Ooh, this is gonna be good!')"}, {"i": 125, "start": 188.24, "end": 188.74, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Finger bang"}, {"i": 126, "start": 188.74, "end": 189.68, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Pot breaks"}, {"i": 127, "start": 189.68, "end": 190.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Wha-?"}, {"i": 128, "start": 190.18, "end": 190.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Why did you—?"}, {"i": 129, "start": 190.96, "end": 191.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "VEGETA!"}, {"i": 130, "start": 191.7, "end": 193.1, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "WHAT ARE YOU DOING!?"}, {"i": 131, "start": 193.22, "end": 195.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Mr. Popo", "text": "WHO JUST BROKE RULE SIX?!"}, {"i": 132, "start": 195.76, "end": 197.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "*I will remember this, Namekian*."}, {"i": 133, "start": 197.72, "end": 198.56, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Please do."}, {"i": 134, "start": 198.56, "end": 200.5, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Vegeta flies away"}, {"i": 135, "start": 201.42, "end": 202.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "[Sigh]"}, {"i": 136, "start": 202.76, "end": 203.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Mm-hm."}, {"i": 137, "start": 203.26, "end": 204.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Magically Fixes Pot", "text": "PICCOLO: Mm-hm."}, {"i": 138, "start": 204.04, "end": 204.82, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Anime popping sound"}, {"i": 139, "start": 204.82, "end": 205.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Mm-hm."}, {"i": 140, "start": 206.24, "end": 207.54, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Still so freakin' metro."}, {"i": 141, "start": 208.0, "end": 209.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "I should make myself a bed."}, {"i": 142, "start": 209.5, "end": 210.18, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "NAIL: 'Gee, you think?'"}, {"i": 143, "start": 211.12, "end": 212.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Krillin", "text": "Well, honestly."}, {"i": 144, "start": 212.04, "end": 213.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Krillin", "text": "I'm honored you thought of me, Vegeta."}, {"i": 145, "start": 213.92, "end": 215.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Krillin", "text": "If you don't go Super Saiyan, who knows?"}, {"i": 146, "start": 215.5, "end": 216.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Krillin", "text": "Maybe I'll have a—"}, {"i": 147, "start": 216.22, "end": 218.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "No, not you, you neurotic imp!"}, {"i": 148, "start": 218.58, "end": 219.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "Your woman!"}, {"i": 149, "start": 219.54, "end": 220.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "Hey Vegeta!"}, {"i": 150, "start": 220.72, "end": 221.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "How are the arms?"}, {"i": 151, "start": 221.86, "end": 222.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "They're fine..."}, {"i": 152, "start": 222.58, "end": 223.2, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Stammering"}, {"i": 153, "start": 223.2, "end": 224.1, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "—NEVER MIND!"}, {"i": 154, "start": 224.1, "end": 225.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "GET OUT HERE!"}, {"i": 155, "start": 225.06, "end": 226.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "YOU OWE ME A REMATCH!"}, {"i": 156, "start": 226.64, "end": 228.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "I owe a lot of people a lot of things."}, {"i": 157, "start": 228.7, "end": 229.74, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "Most of them money."}, {"i": 158, "start": 229.74, "end": 230.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "One an organ."}, {"i": 159, "start": 230.86, "end": 232.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "One a live tiger..."}, {"i": 160, "start": 232.02, "end": 234.46, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Krillin", "text": "Yeah, your brother keeps calling about that."}, {"i": 161, "start": 234.46, "end": 236.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "But I don't owe you shit."}, {"i": 162, "start": 236.8, "end": 239.16, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "You beat your kid, and ignore your wife."}, {"i": 163, "start": 239.16, "end": 242.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "And when you're not doing that, you're trying to start fights with people because of your..."}, {"i": 164, "start": 242.62, "end": 243.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "And when you're not doing that you're trying to start fights with people because of your *screaming*"}, {"i": 165, "start": 243.26, "end": 243.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "And when you're not doing that you're trying to start fights with people because of your *screaming ego*."}, {"i": 166, "start": 244.24, "end": 245.74, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "You remind me of my dad, but..."}, {"i": 167, "start": 245.74, "end": 248.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "At least he had the common courtesy to stay dead."}, {"i": 168, "start": 248.56, "end": 251.98, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "So take your massive inferiority complex the hell off our beach..."}, {"i": 169, "start": 251.98, "end": 254.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "and maybe I'll fight you again someday."}, {"i": 170, "start": 254.32, "end": 257.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "When you stop acting like such a massive..."}, {"i": 171, "start": 257.54, "end": 258.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "...C*nt."}, {"i": 172, "start": 258.04, "end": 258.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Lazuli", "text": "(Holy shit, she just pulled a grudge!) ...C*nt."}, {"i": 173, "start": 258.66, "end": 260.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "[Stammering again]"}, {"i": 174, "start": 260.96, "end": 262.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "After that, I looked for Triclops, but he's completely off the grid."}, {"i": 175, "start": 262.5, "end": 264.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "(FYI, he means Tien Shinhan) VEGETA: After that, I looked for Triclops, but he's completely off the grid."}, {"i": 176, "start": 265.04, "end": 266.76, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "So all that's left was..."}, {"i": 177, "start": 267.76, "end": 268.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "...You."}, {"i": 178, "start": 268.76, "end": 270.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Well, what about Yam—"}, {"i": 179, "start": 270.26, "end": 272.03, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "*I will obliterate your home*."}, {"i": 180, "start": 272.03, "end": 273.14, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "(Oh, so now there's a 'Yamcha button'?) GOHAN: Okay, geez."}, {"i": 181, "start": 273.14, "end": 273.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "(Oh, so now there's a 'Yamcha button'?) Geez, I'm..."}, {"i": 182, "start": 274.5, "end": 275.46, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "I-I'm sorry..."}, {"i": 183, "start": 275.46, "end": 276.16, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Damn straight you should be."}, {"i": 184, "start": 276.16, "end": 277.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "But I'm still not going to fight you."}, {"i": 185, "start": 277.84, "end": 278.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "OH! C'M--"}, {"i": 186, "start": 278.58, "end": 279.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "SERIOUSLY!?!?!"}, {"i": 187, "start": 279.5, "end": 281.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "I don't like fighting, Vegeta!"}, {"i": 188, "start": 281.88, "end": 283.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "I only did it because it was do or die."}, {"i": 189, "start": 283.18, "end": 284.52, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "I only did it because it was *literally* do or die."}, {"i": 190, "start": 284.64, "end": 286.42, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "And frankly, at this point...."}, {"i": 191, "start": 286.42, "end": 287.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "I'd be fighting you..."}, {"i": 192, "start": 287.84, "end": 288.88, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "...Out of *pity*."}, {"i": 193, "start": 289.6, "end": 290.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Is that what you want?"}, {"i": 194, "start": 291.22, "end": 292.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "A pity fight?"}, {"i": 195, "start": 292.44, "end": 295.08, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "At this point, he'd rather have a broken arm or a bruised dick."}, {"i": 196, "start": 295.68, "end": 296.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Yeah..."}, {"i": 197, "start": 297.28, "end": 298.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Goodbye, Vegeta."}, {"i": 198, "start": 298.18, "end": 300.1, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Flies off"}, {"i": 199, "start": 300.1, "end": 306.84, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Wind blows"}, {"i": 200, "start": 306.84, "end": 308.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "('Welp, only one person I can turn to at a time like this.')"}, {"i": 201, "start": 309.48, "end": 311.38, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Who's he gonna call...?"}, {"i": 202, "start": 312.62, "end": 313.64, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "GHOST NAPPA!!!"}, {"i": 203, "start": 313.64, "end": 314.62, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Though he ain't a ghost no more.) (GHOST NAPPA!!!"}, {"i": 204, "start": 317.0, "end": 318.1, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Phone turns on] [Phone vibrates"}, {"i": 205, "start": 319.5, "end": 320.0, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Footsteps"}, {"i": 206, "start": 320.0, "end": 321.62, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Phone vibrates] [Footsteps"}, {"i": 207, "start": 321.62, "end": 322.6, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Footsteps"}, {"i": 208, "start": 323.66, "end": 324.48, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Phone vibrates"}, {"i": 209, "start": 324.48, "end": 325.92, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "Oop, 36 missed calls."}, {"i": 210, "start": 325.92, "end": 326.7, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Chuckles"}, {"i": 211, "start": 326.72, "end": 328.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Phone Vibrates", "text": "NAPPA: ...Not pulling the pin on *that* grenade."}, {"i": 212, "start": 328.04, "end": 329.38, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": "...Not pulling the pin on *that* grenade."}, {"i": 213, "start": 330.3, "end": 332.32, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Hey Piccolo made his bed! 0u0"}, {"i": 214, "start": 333.9, "end": 340.14, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Let's give a big thank you to YouTube for letting us devise on our own subtitles up until now."}, {"i": 215, "start": 340.14, "end": 342.94, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Goodbye 'Add subtitles/CC' option."}, {"i": 216, "start": 342.94, "end": 345.3, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "You shall be missed."}, {"i": 217, "start": 345.3, "end": 347.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Nappa", "text": ":'( (Seriously.)"}], "segments": []}